{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Break the Bond and Stay Close to Your Linky</strong><br>Linkies is a platformer that you could play with your friends. The closer you stay to your Linky, the higher you can jump and the faster you can move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Parkour Levels</strong> <br>Embark on a journey to the edge of outer space with every jump! Don\u2019t be fooled by the game\u2019s simple controls; you must work in harmony with your Linky. Panic, and you risk falling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stronger Together</strong> <br>The bond mechanic in Linkies is a fresh twist on co-op platformers. It\u2019s not a racing game, but a true test of your relationship with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Communication</strong> <br>Linkies enables you to communicate with your friends in-game. It lets you strategize together or even sabotage each other. Make sure you have real bonds with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sabotage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to carry your friend or bump them to make them fall. Are your friendships strong enough to reach the end?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063950?t=1764274653","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063950?t=1764274653","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/01f1825b47c10de3feccaba9b1be87b66e5ed4a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764274653","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/01f1825b47c10de3feccaba9b1be87b66e5ed4a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764274653","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternati